id: ops-publish-indirection
title: Reject unresolved alias and function publish indirection in canonical attestation auditor
description: "Canonical repair for GitHub issue #149. Real shell aliases, forwarding functions and variable-routed xargs can execute unattested publishes while a sanctioned sibling satisfies non-vacuity. Companion owner: pm-cli-website-session-2026-10-10."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 0
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-10T02:41:49.896Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-10T06:00:18.046Z"
author: codex-sol
acceptance_criteria: Real subprocess adversarial fixtures and independent revert proofs; reject unresolved executable indirection; preserve sanctioned workflow; full release and packed npm/Bun checks.
repro_steps: Execute test/publish-indirection.test.ts against the prior attestation implementation; Bash/xargs inert publisher records show hidden publish calls behind an attested sibling.
expected_result: Every unresolved executable publisher path is refused; direct sanctioned provenance workflows and provable bindings remain accepted.
actual_result: "Canonical auditor preserves safe whoami/ping, fail-closed unknown publishers and provenance ordering. Renewed Windows findings4236589192/4236589194 are fixed using actual installed npm/npx Node CLI entries without npm_execpath or shell argument interpolation, native PATH normalization and Windows consumer environment. Source086b52e0a1660132b805c3695fd728eb0ccd9dc9 CI38029183548 passes Linux22/26 and Windows22/26. Native Windows standalone pack and packed npm/nativeBun consumers pass; each source-only launcher revert fails independently and actual npm10.9.4 is refused before packing. Final unchanged release:check passes496 of498 with2 existing opt-in skips and four100 over all23 production TS sources. Fresh local packed npm/nativeBun and PM-linked2/2 pass. Ambient local extension-health skew and12 legacy completeness gaps remain; history verification passes. Open for root review, no closure/publication."
comments[16]:
  - created_at: "2026-10-10T02:42:14.991Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Owner search found historical scalar/spawning-wrapper repairs but no owner for #149; this item owns canonical alias/function/indirect spawning repair. Plan: executable safe stubs prove real argv and audit refusal, then mutation restores only prior implementation to prove regression detection. Companion: pm-cli-website-session-2026-10-10. No workflow execution or publication authorized."
  - created_at: "2026-10-10T02:53:26.293Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Focused real-subprocess corpus passes 26/26 with zero skips. npm/Bun artifact acceptance is running. Both linked PM tests pass (26/26 indirection, 1/1 pack/install), but project test-result-tracking is disabled, so explicit comments hold the receipts. No tracking policy changed. Existing release-workflow audit passes with one recognized provenance invocation. New opaque argument and executable paths are refused even with a literal flag; plain scalar/array flags and fully literal function bodies remain accepted."
  - created_at: "2026-10-10T03:02:44.248Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Fail-on-revert proof at base fedeb7bf19241fa2e9ce3ae9d263bc1e091729a4: restoring only attestation.ts made the 26-test corpus fail 18 cases (8 still pass). All repaired bytes restored. Real npm config get confirms --provenance followed by --no-provenance yields false, reverse order true. Both npm and native Bun packed consumers pass actual SDK activation and built auditor checks. No registry publication occurred."
  - created_at: "2026-10-10T03:14:32.322Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Precision follow-up: the full gate caught a quoted case-arm pattern being counted as an extra opaque executable. The guard now retains unresolved evidence specifically at quoted executable scalar references before expansion, preserving word boundaries without treating whitespace in a case label as a command. The original exact-count case-arm regression and all 128 focused attestation tests pass unchanged; braced and unknown executable references are covered. No existing assertions were weakened."
  - created_at: "2026-10-10T03:21:01.223Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Final source release:check passes 496 tests with zero failures and two existing opt-in skips; four-dimensional coverage 100% across 23 files. Focused attestation set passes 128/128 with no skips. New combined real-subprocess and pack regressions pass 27/27. Fail-on-revert restores only base attestation.ts and fails 18/26 cases; all repaired bytes restored. Final packed Node/npm and native Bun auditor and SDK activation pass. No live publish command executed. Full evidence and limits: docs/publication-repair.md."
  - created_at: "2026-10-10T03:23:46.867Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Review candidate: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ops/pull/152, implementation c73e0effbff8c4c493f49e3fa15c5c7208b4f151. Claim released; item remains unclosed pending orchestrator verification. Full gate, corpus, packed acceptance and independent revert proof are documented."
  - created_at: "2026-10-10T03:57:24.045Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Orchestrator review corrections verified: first unresolved-publication diagnostic, clean-checkout packed parent creation, and current SDK9 actual_result. TDD old diagnostic and absent coverage directory each fail; repaired focused129/129 and fresh packed npm/native Bun pass. Full release:check passes496 tests with2 pre-existing opt-in skips and four100 across23configured sources. docs/publication-repair.md distinguishes PR152 from independent PR150; no merge or release."
  - created_at: "2026-10-10T04:48:29.824Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "CodeRabbit current-head findings4236402851/2857/2861 verified: real readonly whoami/ping expansions falsely refused, pack fixture used POSIX-only launcher/PATH, and npm11 pack label lacked independent major proof. Old source fails readonly regression. Add safe verbs while unknown verbs remain fail-closed; native fixture uses platform launcher/delimiter; packed acceptance asserts ambient npm11 before any pack receipt. Windows native execution remains unverified locally."
  - created_at: "2026-10-10T05:09:09.575Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Final review corrections: real npm10.9.4 negative control exit1 with exact major-proof diagnostic before packing. Read-only regression fails against old set then passes; final27 real corpus/pack tests pass. Full source gate passes496 with2 existing opt-in skips, four100 across23 sources. Updated fixture uses native Windows launcher/PATH and direct installed npm CLI to avoid cmd spawning; native Windows runtime unverified locally. Fresh packed npm/nativeBun pass actual npm11 major and npm10 ignore-scripts configuration identity. Existing unpatched development vulnerabilities and12 legacy closed metadata gaps remain documented, as does independent PR150 authorization parser work."
  - created_at: "2026-10-10T05:46:45.583Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Review-loop continuation from ea29cb425a72b6729d24b00df4573e8c092c7cfa: renewed CodeRabbit review 5477818338 findings 4236589192 and 4236589194 both match test launcher source. Standalone Windows pack requires npm_execpath and packed acceptance directly spawns npm/npx cmd shims. Verify installed npm CLI layout and Node APIs, add real-consumer regression evidence with source-only reverts, extend existing public CI for native Windows Node 22/26 if needed. Preserve npm 11 identity, runtime SDK pin, all 23 production TS coverage inventory and existing two opt-in fleet skips. No publishing, hosted changes, duplicate owner, bot comments or item closure."
  - created_at: "2026-10-10T05:47:51.182Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Native red-first plan: existing CI gains a Windows Server 2025 Node22/26 consumer job with SHA-pinned checkout/setup-node/setup-bun actions, matching existing pin conventions. Commands explicitly remove npm_execpath and run the standalone fixture and packed consumers independently. Repo is public; standard Windows runners are free per GitHub docs. This first evidence commit retains both old launcher implementations so native failures can be recorded before source changes."
  - created_at: "2026-10-10T05:51:11.907Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Native red receipt: CI run38028728667 on90e66071740a7c660656236697a3eb9c78744631. Both Windows22/26 jobs fail standalone pack with exact missing-npm_execpath assertion and packed acceptance at npm --version with null spawn status; job114145004384 logs independently retrieved. Linux publication gate also flags the newly added explicit PowerShell exit expression; split native commands into separate steps and rely on GitHub's documented default pwsh exit handling, preserving canonical fail-closed auditing. Local focused27/27 and fresh packed npm/Node plus nativeBun pass. PM-linked tests2/2 pass; result tracking remains disabled, receipts are explicit comments."
  - created_at: "2026-10-10T05:54:59.625Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Native run38028953883 exposes two test-environment details before acceptance: Windows env spread retains Path but env.PATH is undefined when constructing a plain object, so fixture PATH prepend loses the system executables; normalize PATH from process.env. Node22 correctly refuses actual bundled npm10.9.9 under isolated npm config after an ambient user-prefix upgrade; CI now installs npm11 beside the selected Node executable. Resolver distinguishes npm's bundled prefix redirect from npm-generated global shims using the installed launcher and metadata; global shims directly target their adjacent CLI. No fake npm identity or guard weakening. First local full release:check passed496/498 with2 opt-in skips and four100 across23 sources; a final related-fix gate will run after native stabilization."
  - created_at: "2026-10-10T05:55:55.669Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Native Node26 packed npm and Bun consumers passed on94f6b8a4a14f3b8a4db3476ea32309a6f945aba4 (run38028953883/job114145663748), including actual SDK activation, tracker create/validate/strict health, npm11 pack and npm10 --ignore-scripts config identity. Standalone pack remained red at PATH construction and is repaired separately. Native proof script normalizes the same Windows PATH before its npm10 negative control. Both source-only revert controls restore original bytes in finally blocks; CLI receipt logs identify actual installed npm/npx Node entrypoints."
  - created_at: "2026-10-10T05:56:53.795Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Latest source candidate086b52e0a1660132b805c3695fd728eb0ccd9dc9 has native CI run38029183548. Superseded run38029161156 was canceled to avoid duplicate public-runner work; canceled evidence is not approval. Actual local npm10.9.4 control via npx --yes --package npm@10.9.4 -- node test/packed-consumer.acceptance.ts exits1 at the exact npm11-major guard before pack. Current local full-extension health fails ambient host/extension version skew (global host10 vs pm-ops SDK9, pinned host9 vs ambient pm-github10). Storage-only strict health passes with required merge drivers; separate pinned validation retains12 existing closed completeness gaps and zero history drift. Preserve pins and environment; existing certification context ops-hiee applies, no new defect established."
  - created_at: "2026-10-10T05:59:39.491Z"
    author: codex-sol
    text: "Verified green native receipt: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ops/actions/runs/38029183548 at086b52e0a1660132b805c3695fd728eb0ccd9dc9. Windows22 job114146337599 and Windows26 job114146337560 both pass standalone pack without npm_execpath, packed npm and nativeBun consumers, and node test/windows-consumers.proof.ts. Logs identify actual npm/npx Node CLI entrypoints and version11.21.0, both source-only reverts fail with exact old diagnostics and restore repaired bytes, actual npm10.9.4 is rejected before pack. Both Linux22/26 jobs also pass. Final local npm run release:check exits0:498 total496 passed0 failed2 existing fleet opt-in skips; all23 authored production TS sources report100 statements/branches/functions/lines, no exclusions/threshold changes. Docstrings222 across23 selected files, duplication0/23023 across48 sources, production audit0 and retained development audit5 high. npm run accept:packed passes fresh npm/Node and nativeBun independently. SDK/pins and production code are unchanged since ea29cb425a72b6729d24b00df4573e8c092c7cfa; required review remains pending. History verifies, existing12 old completeness gaps retained, full ambient extension health skew remains explicitly unremediated."
